          "worked": "For $\\sin\\theta\\ne0$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\cot^2\\theta-1}{\\cot^2\\theta+1}&=\\frac{\\cot^2\\theta-1}{\\operatorname{cosec}^2\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\cot^2\\theta-1}{\\cot^2\\theta+1}&=\\cot^2\\theta\\sin^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta\\\\\\frac{\\cot^2\\theta-1}{\\cot^2\\theta+1}&=\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta\\\\\\frac{\\cot^2\\theta-1}{\\cot^2\\theta+1}&=1-2\\sin^2\\theta.\\end{align*}$$\nThus LHS equals RHS.",
