                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\mathrm{LHS}=\\frac{\\sec\\theta-\\tan\\theta}{\\sec\\theta+\\tan\\theta}=\\frac{1-\\sin\\theta}{1+\\sin\\theta}",
