          "worked": "On the common domain $\\sin\\theta\\ne0$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1+\\cos\\theta}&=\\frac{\\sin\\theta(1-\\cos\\theta)}{1-\\cos^2\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1+\\cos\\theta}&=\\frac{\\sin\\theta(1-\\cos\\theta)}{\\sin^2\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1+\\cos\\theta}&=\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1+\\cos\\theta}&=\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta-\\cot\\theta.\\end{align*}$$\nThus LHS equals RHS.",
