          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(1+\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^2&=(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^2+2(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)+1\\\\(1+\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^2&=\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta+2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta+2(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)+1\\\\(1+\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^2&=2+2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta+2\\sin\\theta+2\\cos\\theta\\\\(1+\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^2&=2(1+\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta+\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta)\\\\(1+\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^2&=2(1+\\sin\\theta)(1+\\cos\\theta).\\end{align*}$$\nThus LHS equals RHS for all real $\\theta$.",
